# Only the two tests this task fixed, serially: the injection is deterministic,
# so the proof must not depend on the 561-test suite or on the ambient load
# that originally exposed these two. `--test-threads=1` also keeps the injected
# 3s delay in `stop_and_join_driver_producer` from being paid by anything else.
